{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2020-06", "window": 2, "start_date": 1591574400, "end_date": 1592265599, "month_true_total": 64, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:48:47 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "70704607", "author": {"steamid": "76561198157489480", "personaname": "VorticalSquare4", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/VorticalSquare4/", "num_games_owned": 109, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3595, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 827, "last_played": 1788058152, "avatar": "e73c68a62a6e253901b9c35c14072ce7ec0ec866"}, "language": "english", "review": "If I had to describe this game with 2 words I would say \"Danger close\".\nHere's some helpful criteria to determine if you'll enjoy this game:\nDo you enjoy explosions?\nDo you enjoy Mech suits?\nDo you enjoy fighting hordes of faceless enemies?\nDo you REALLY hate bugs?\nDo you think you might enjoy chanting \"E.D.F\" whilst defending Earth from said hordes of faceless enemies?\nIf you answered \"Yes\" to 2 or more of the above criteria, you will probably enjoy this game.\n\nNote: You may not enjoy this game if you expect the following:\nA well written plot.\nVaried environments.\nGood voice acting.\nTaking oneself seriously in any capacity.\nGood treatment of various insects, amphibians, arachnids, extraterrestrials etc.", "timestamp_created": 1592019897, "timestamp_updated": 1592019897, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "70670905", "author": {"steamid": "76561198313219756", "personaname": "nexodrone", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198313219756/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 47979, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 30557, "last_played": 1712403119, "avatar": "63fa4306f28b0d8eed5f295bb666516a33a4cc25"}, "language": "english", "review": "gud game", "timestamp_created": 1591961323, "timestamp_updated": 1591961323, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "70653345", "author": {"steamid": "76561197976095981", "personaname": "Freedom Eagleburger", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/billybobgeorgebob/", "num_games_owned": 1646, "num_reviews": 206, "playtime_forever": 3038, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2747, "last_played": 1610154615, "avatar": "8e58742012fa8e2d3699c74ed532a0767472a315"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is the game you see people playing in cartoons, tv shows and movies\n\nThis is raw distilled video game.\n\nThis is literally Video Game: The Video Game\n\nWe don't need plot. \"Aliens have landed.\" There, that's your plot.\n\nYou feel like it might be a bargain bin game, but it has some of the best pacing level-wise. New Alien Type shows up, you panic, you shoot it, you get good at killing it, then a new alien type shows up. Rinse, repeat.\n\nAlthough, wait for sales, as $60 is too high for this game.", "timestamp_created": 1591922717, "timestamp_updated": 1591922717, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "70556602", "author": {"steamid": "76561198007511644", "personaname": "GIGroundNPound", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GIGroundNPound/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 76, "playtime_forever": 10369, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 962, "last_played": 1642566359, "avatar": "02aa59d2793a60802f833c6e9b5ea6f7dfd6020f"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really just cannot say enough how much I LOVE THIS DAMNED GAME! If you have ever wanted to be in a position to face an unending horde of bugs and have a hankering to \"LIVE FOREVER\" and earn your citizenship then THIS IS THE GAME FOR YOU! This 3rd person shooter is just awesome, the different types of character classes combined with an unending array of replay ability and online & split screen local co-op make this one of my favorite 3rd person shooters of all time!", "timestamp_created": 1591739887, "timestamp_updated": 1591739887, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "70554321", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084600103", "personaname": "Jaberu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198084600103/", "num_games_owned": 308, "num_reviews": 142, "playtime_forever": 7660, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2376, "last_played": 1760652335, "avatar": "f7f5510f11c19e2eb82f8622584baba5a76637ed"}, "language": "english", "review": "killing ants , is there something more amusing than that ?", "timestamp_created": 1591735635, "timestamp_updated": 1591735635, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.540229856967926025", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "